Date: Mon, 17 Aug 2026 11:29:53 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 05/30] Fix static asset paths for GitHub Pages subpath
 deployment

Hardcoded absolute paths (/logo.png, /course/nine_grid_alt.png) in
index.html and components broke when served from a GitHub Pages
project subpath (https://<user>.github.io/CloudSteps/), because the
browser resolved them against the domain root instead of the subpath.

- index.html: use Vite's %BASE_URL% placeholder for logo/og/twitter
  image paths so they get rewritten at build time.
- Login.tsx, header.tsx, MemoryLighthouse.tsx: prefix public asset
  src with import.meta.env.BASE_URL so they resolve correctly under
  any base path.

Generated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)

Co-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 web/index.html                          | 6 +++---
 web/src/components/MemoryLighthouse.tsx | 2 +-
 web/src/components/header.tsx           | 2 +-
 web/src/pages/Login.tsx                 | 2 +-
 4 files changed, 6 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)

diff --git a/web/index.html b/web/index.html
index 073946e..aefd6a9 100644
--- a/web/index.html
+++ b/web/index.html
@@ -17,9 +17,9 @@
         rel="stylesheet"
       />
 
-      <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/logo.png" />
-      <meta property="og:image" content="/logo.png" />
-      <meta name="twitter:image" content="/logo.png" />
+      <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="%BASE_URL%logo.png" />
+      <meta property="og:image" content="%BASE_URL%logo.png" />
+      <meta name="twitter:image" content="%BASE_URL%logo.png" />
 
       <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
       <meta property="og:title" content="云阶" />
diff --git a/web/src/components/MemoryLighthouse.tsx b/web/src/components/MemoryLighthouse.tsx
index 6390526..ff87f93 100644
--- a/web/src/components/MemoryLighthouse.tsx
+++ b/web/src/components/MemoryLighthouse.tsx
